        "subheading": "<p><strong>JOIN US</strong></p>",
        "title": "<p>A Study In Colour</p>",
        "description": "<p><strong>2-4th October | Paddington Showroom</strong></p><p>For the first time, we invite you to experience A Study in Colour, our first  Gemstone Trunk Show.</p><p>For three days only, discover a curated collection of one-of-a-kind natural gemstones, alongside exclusive finished pieces created especially for the occasion. Our most-loved signatures have been reimagined through colour, with new Eirene designs also making their debut.</p><p>From luminous yellow sapphires and Ceylon sapphires to vivid blue topaz and rich pink garnets, each gemstone has been selected for its individual colour, character and natural beauty.</p><p><strong>Walk-ins are welcomed, or book an appointment</strong> with a Bespoke Consultant to secure dedicated one-on-one time throughout the weekend.</p>",
